{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03323","headline":"送沙门泓景道俊玄奘还荆州应制 · 宋之问","name":"送沙门泓景道俊玄奘还荆州应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三乘归净域，万骑饯通庄。\n就日离亭近，弥天别路长。\n荆南旋杖鉢，渭北限津梁。\n何日纡真果，还来入帝乡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋之问","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03323.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03323","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}